msgid "What is it about?"
msgstr ""

#: app/event_guide.py:22
msgid ""
"Two or three sentences: what happens, why it is worth coming and what the"
" mood will be."
msgstr ""

#: app/event_guide.py:24
msgid ""
"An evening for founders and freelancers: short talks about first "
"customers, then relaxed conversations over dinner."
msgstr ""

#: app/event_guide.py:25
msgid ""
"A hands-on workshop: we build a simple landing page together and everyone"
" leaves with a working draft."
msgstr ""

#: app/event_guide.py:26
msgid ""
"A Sunday walk along the Main with coffee stops. A chance to get to know "
"club members outside of work."
msgstr ""

